  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis of avocado value chain in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this study is twofold:&#x2022;	firstly, to analyse and map the intervention potential to stimulate local private sector development in the avocado value chain and,&#x2022;	secondly, to look for business opportunities for Dutch companies within in the framework of the combi-track &quot;Sustainable, climate resilient agri-food systems &amp; forests&quot;, focused on sustainable sourcing and monitoring in the avocado value chain, connecting Colombian farmers to the Dutch (and EU) markets and consumers.The combi-track approach should make Colombian agri-food systems more productive and sustainable, creating new jobs and stimulating Colombian private sector initiatives, by applying Dutch knowledge &amp; technology.</narrative>
  </description>
